sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Client
    participant DB as Local SQLite
    participant S as Sync service
    participant O as Object storage

    U->>C: Enter expense and receipt
    C->>DB: Save entry and outbox command (one transaction)
    C-->>U: Show local result with unsynced indicator
    C->>S: POST /v1/sync/commands
    S->>S: Validate, commit state, idempotency record and change record
    S-->>C: Results (applied, conflict, ...)
    C->>S: POST /v1/receipts/upload-intents
    S-->>C: Presigned upload URL
    C->>O: PUT receipt bytes
    C->>S: POST /v1/receipts/{id}/complete
    S-->>C: Asset quarantined until scanned
    C->>S: GET /v1/sync/changes?cursor=
    S-->>C: Changes and new cursor
    C->>DB: Apply changes, keep pending commands as overlays
